		{"id":"wps","type":"text","text":"# Repository File Index\n\n[Open Repository File Index](docs/indexes/CC_Repository%20File%20Index.md)\n\nUse this index to locate repository files and documentation.","x":0,"y":520,"width":300,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"indexes","type":"text","text":"# Master Implementation Index\n\n[Open Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)\n\nUse this index to navigate implementation work packages and their references.","x":0,"y":680,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"matrix","type":"text","text":"# Phase 4 Matrix\n\n[Open matrix folder](docs/architecture/phase-4-matrix/)","x":0,"y":860,"width":300,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"done-foundation","type":"text","text":"# Foundation & Data\n\n**WP10 · WP11**\n\nImplementation foundation and Project Record data layer.\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)","x":360,"y":360,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"done-gateway","type":"text","text":"# Gateway & Provider\n\n**WP13 · WP14**\n\nGateway root navigation and the Obsidian ProjectRecord provider are implemented and verified.\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)","x":360,"y":540,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"done-dashboard","type":"text","text":"# Dashboard Core\n\n**WP15 · WP16**\n\nResolution handling and Dashboard core content implemented. WP16 closure decisions remain open.\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)","x":360,"y":740,"width":300,"height":170,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"workspace","type":"text","text":"# Project Workspace\n\nReconcile Dashboard/Workspace requirements before defining the Workspace specification.\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)\n\n[Near-Term Roadmap](CC_Working_Notes/CC%20%E2%80%94%20Near-Term%20Roadmap%202026-10-02.md)","x":1080,"y":360,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"later","type":"text","text":"# Remaining Work\n\n- Dashboard Attention and Workspace navigation\n- Dashboard-to-Workspace action\n- Staleness and AI Progress Estimate derivation\n- New Project creation and persistence\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)","x":1080,"y":570,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"future-architecture","type":"text","text":"# Tool Ecosystem & Host Independence\n\nEvolve CC toward an independent project operating environment with a configurable tool ecosystem. Reduce dependence on Obsidian as host while retaining its capabilities through supported integrations.\n\nUsers configure tools globally and per project, including third-party apps, AI providers, and native CC extensions.\n\n**Status:** Future consideration — not an approved specification or implementation commitment.","x":1440,"y":360,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# COMMAND CENTER\n\nPersonal development board. GitHub and the authoritative project documents remain the source of truth.","x":660,"y":-60,"width":420,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"wp16","type":"text","text":"# WP16 — Dashboard Decisions\n\n**Status:** Pending architectural rulings\n\n- **Blockers display:** Reconcile WP16 D2 with UI Architecture Specification §6.\n- **Staleness:** Decide how stale Dashboard information is identified and presented.\n\n**Next action:** Resolve both rulings and update the authoritative documentation.\n\n[WP16 Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP16%20Dashboard%20Core-Content%20Specification.md)\n\n[UI Architecture Specification](docs/architecture/CC_UI%20Architecture%20Specification%20v1.0.md)","x":720,"y":770,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"wp12","type":"text","text":"# WP12 — Up Button Verification\n\n**Status:** Pending verification\n\nVerify the `goUp()` success path. Current framework verification cannot exercise it because no controller action sets `depth` to `workspace`.\n\n**Next action:** Resolve the verification gap and determine whether an implementation change is needed.\n\n[WP12 Implementation Notes](docs/implementation/CC_Phase%204_WP12%20Implementation%20Notes.md)\n\n[Slice 9B Verification Protocol](docs/verification/WP12%20Step%205%20-%20Slice%209B%20Framework%20Verification%20Protocol.md)","x":720,"y":400,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"3"}
	],
